description=SDK14 Codec2 core for verified API32 firmware with guarded AVC/HEVC eight-bit buffer routing and serialized stop. Full ten-bit/P010 and HDR preserved, independent buffer/backend switches and reboot rollback. Original kernel, player and hooks retained.
